        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='min-height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;container-type:inline-size;background:#ffffff;font-family:Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#0f172a'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px clamp(20px,5cqw,40px) 64px'><div style='padding:10px 0;border-top:3px solid #0f172a;border-bottom:1px solid #0f172a;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#0f766e'>NODE CLASS · workflow</div><header style='padding:40px 0 32px'><h1 style='margin:0;font:500 clamp(40px,9.5cqw,72px)/.98 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;text-wrap:balance;color:#0f172a'>Workflow</h1><p style='margin:18px 0 0;max-width:38ch;font:italic 400 clamp(20px,3.6cqw,26px)/1.35 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#475569'>A reusable procedure bound by questionId to an independent Question and verifiable answer contract.</p></header><figure style='margin:0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e'>Specimen</h2><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;padding:28px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2f6'><div style='max-width:100%'><div style='width:460px;max-width:100%;height:340px'><div style='container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;padding:4.7cqw;background:#113644;border:2px solid #40777e;border-radius:19px;color:white;font-family:system-ui'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2cqw;justify-content:space-between'><span style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.6cqw,15px)/1.2 system-ui;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#8fe9cf'>PROCESS</span><span style='width:2.4cqw;height:2.4cqw;min-width:8px;min-height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#8fe9cf'></span></div><div style='font:650 clamp(18px,5.3cqw,32px)/1.12 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin-top:3.4cqw;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden'>Untitled workflow</div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Purpose</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'>What this workflow accomplishes</div></div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Trigger</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'>manual</div></div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Resource bindings</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'></div></div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Required tools</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'></div></div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Policy reference</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'></div></div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Run record destination</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'></div></div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Inputs</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'>Input names, one per line</div></div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Outputs</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'>Output names, one per line</div></div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Execution mode</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'>agent-assisted</div></div><div style='min-width:0;margin-top:2.7cqw;'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,1.7cqw,13px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fe9cf;opacity:.9'>Status</div><div style='font:500 clamp(12px,2.8cqw,20px)/1.4 system-ui;white-space:pre-line;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#e2eef1;'>draft</div></div></div></div><div style='margin-top:10px;font:700 11px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#475569'>Detail · 490 by 350</div></div><div><div style='width:214.2857142857143px;height:142.85714285714286px'><div style='container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;padding:4cqw;background:#113644;border:1px solid #40777e;border-radius:18px;color:white;font-family:system-ui;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5cqw'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;min-height:0'><span style='flex:0 0 auto;font:800 clamp(9px,2.8cqw,12px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#8fe9cf'>PROCESS</span><span style='min-width:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:1cqw;font:750 clamp(9px,2.9cqw,12px)/1.2 system-ui;color:#8fe9cf;text-transform:uppercase'><span style='white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>draft</span></span></div><div style='flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center'><div style='width:100%;font:750 clamp(21px,9cqw,34px)/1.07 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden'>Untitled workflow</div></div><div style='min-height:0;border-top:1px solid #40777e;padding-top:1.7cqw'><div style='font:800 clamp(9px,2.55cqw,11px)/1.15 system-ui;letter-spacing:.065em;color:#8fe9cf;text-transform:uppercase'>Purpose</div><div style='margin-top:.6cqw;font:520 clamp(13px,4.1cqw,17px)/1.3 system-ui;color:#e2eef1;white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:anywhere;overflow:hidden;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical'>What this workflow accomplishes</div></div></div></div><div style='margin-top:10px;font:700 11px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#475569'>Summary</div><div style='margin-top:24px;width:120px;height:110px'><div style='container-type:inline-size;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #40777e;border-radius:14px;background:#113644;color:#f7fbff;font-family:system-ui'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true' viewBox='0 0 320 198' width='100%' height='100%' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid slice' style='position:absolute;inset:0;display:block'><rect width='320' height='198' fill='#113644'/><path d='M0 46 H320 M0 49 H320' fill='none' stroke='#40777e' stroke-width='1.5' opacity='.45'/><text x='19' y='30' fill='#8fe9cf' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14' font-weight='800' letter-spacing='1.25'>PROCESS</text><g transform='translate(246 73)'><path d='M0 -54 L53 0 L0 54 L-53 0 Z' fill='none' stroke='#8fe9cf' stroke-width='7' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='.9'/><path d='M0 -32 L31 0 L0 32 L-31 0 Z' fill='#8fe9cf' fill-opacity='.28' stroke='#8fe9cf' stroke-opacity='.82' stroke-width='4'/><circle cx='0' cy='0' r='7' fill='#8fe9cf'/></g></svg><div style='position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;box-sizing:border-box;height:59%;padding:2cqw 5cqw 3cqw;display:flex;align-items:center;background:rgba(6,26,37,.84);border-top:1px solid #8fe9cf'><div style='width:100%;font:800 clamp(14px,8.5cqw,25px)/1.05 system-ui;letter-spacing:-.025em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden'>Untitled workflow</div></div></div></div><div style='margin-top:10px;font:700 11px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#475569'>Icon</div></div></div><figcaption style='margin-top:10px;font:400 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#475569'><b style='color:#0f172a'>Fig. 1</b> &nbsp;A new Workflow at each of its three sizes, holding its starting values.</figcaption></figure><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;flex-direction:row-reverse;align-items:flex-start;gap:32px 40px;padding-top:44px'><aside style='flex:1 1 220px;min-width:0;padding-top:10px;border-top:3px solid #0f172a'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Settings</h2><dl style='margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr;column-gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1'><dt style='padding:9px 0 9px;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 13px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>Key</dt><dd style='margin:0;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:right;font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a;overflow-wrap:anywhere'>workflow</dd><dt style='padding:9px 0 9px;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 13px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>Label</dt><dd style='margin:0;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:right;font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a;overflow-wrap:anywhere'>Workflow</dd><dt style='padding:9px 0 9px;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 13px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>Size</dt><dd style='margin:0;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:right;font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a;overflow-wrap:anywhere'>490 by 350</dd><dt style='padding:9px 0 9px;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 13px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>Glyph</dt><dd style='margin:0;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:right;font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a;overflow-wrap:anywhere'>Workflow</dd><dt style='grid-column:1/-1;padding:9px 0 0px;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 13px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>Required fields</dt><dd style='grid-column:1/-1;margin:0;padding:2px 0 9px;font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a;overflow-wrap:anywhere'>title, purpose, trigger, mode, status</dd></dl></aside><div style='flex:999 1 380px;min-width:0'><section><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e'>Description and rationale</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#1e293b'><span style='float:left;padding:6px 10px 0 0;font:500 68px/54px Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#0f172a'>O</span>ne reusable process with an explicit purpose, trigger, input/output contract, and steps.</p><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#1e293b'>Class key: `workflow`. Instances hold their authored fields in node.data and render through this class&apos;s faces. Edges connect using named ports; no data JSON blob substitutes for a class.</p></section></div></div><blockquote style='margin:48px 0 0;padding:32px 0;border-top:1px solid #0f172a;border-bottom:1px solid #0f172a'><p style='margin:0 0 12px;font:italic 500 clamp(30px,6.4cqw,46px)/1.1 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.015em;color:#0f766e;text-wrap:balance'>Every Workflow needs a title, a purpose, a trigger, an execution mode and a status.</p><p style='margin:0;font:400 14px/1.5 system-ui;color:#475569'><b style='color:#0f172a'>The fields.</b> 11 in all: title, purpose, trigger, inputs, outputs, execution mode, status, resource bindings, required tools, policy reference and run record destination.</p></blockquote><figure style='margin:40px 0 0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e'>Fields</h2><div style='overflow-x:auto'><table style='border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:460px'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left;padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-top:3px solid #0f172a;border-bottom:1px solid #0f172a;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Field</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-top:3px solid #0f172a;border-bottom:1px solid #0f172a;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Type</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-top:3px solid #0f172a;border-bottom:1px solid #0f172a;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Required</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-top:3px solid #0f172a;border-bottom:1px solid #0f172a;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Starts as</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>title</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>text</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a'>yes</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>Untitled workflow</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>purpose</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>multiline</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a'>yes</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>What this workflow accomplishes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>trigger</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>select (manual, event, scheduled)</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a'>yes</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>manual</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>inputs</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>multiline</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>no</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>Input names, one per line</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>outputs</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>multiline</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>no</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>Output names, one per line</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>mode</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>select (agent-assisted, manual, runner-bound)</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a'>yes</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>agent-assisted</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>status</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>select (draft, rehearsal, validated)</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a'>yes</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>draft</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>resources</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>multiline (Each line: alias = github://... or tlz://...)</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>no</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>—</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>tools</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>multiline (One tool or connector capability per line)</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>no</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>—</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>policyRef</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>text</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>no</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>—</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155;font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>runRecordRef</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>text</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>no</td><td style='padding:11px 16px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#334155'>—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figcaption style='margin-top:10px;font:400 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#475569'><b style='color:#0f172a'>Fig. 2</b> &nbsp;What every node of the class holds, in the order its field rows sit in the graph.</figcaption></figure><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;flex-direction:row-reverse;align-items:flex-start;gap:32px 40px;padding-top:44px'><aside style='flex:1 1 220px;min-width:0;padding-top:10px;border-top:3px solid #0f172a'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Ports</h2><div style='margin:0 0 12px'><div style='font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>root</div><div style='font:400 13px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>bidirectional · top at 0.5 · any edge</div></div><div style='margin:0 0 12px'><div style='font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>members</div><div style='font:400 13px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>output · right at 0.5 · reference</div></div><div style='margin-top:6px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Events</h2><div style='margin:0 0 12px'><div style='font:600 14px/20px ui-monospace,Cascadia Code,Consolas,monospace;color:#0f172a'>node.changed</div><div style='font:400 13px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>Workflow changed</div></div></div></aside><div style='flex:999 1 380px;min-width:0'><section><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e'>Evidence</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#1e293b'>Private prototype generated from the current public Node Class Template. Structural checks performed; editor rendering and runtime binding must be tested in Twilite before canon promotion.</p></section></div></div></div></div>"
